   "title": "Choose a column",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Column 3 has two zeros, so expand along}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{it.}\\\\[5pt]&|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\cos\\theta&-\\sin\\theta&0\\\\\\sin\\theta&\\cos\\theta&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\end{aligned}\\]",
