   "title": "Expand",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&|A|=0\\cdot A_{13}+0\\cdot A_{23}+1\\cdot A_{33}\\\\[5pt]&{}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\cos\\theta&-\\sin\\theta\\\\\\sin\\theta&\\cos\\theta\\end{vmatrix}\\end{aligned}\\]",
