   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&{}=\\cos\\theta\\cos\\theta-(-\\sin\\theta)(\\sin\\theta)\\\\[5pt]&{}=\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{1}}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{This is the determinant of a rotation}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{matrix: a rotation never changes area.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
